    "message": "Derive whole-cell alignment from actual polynomial zeros without occupation premises\n\nCompose the original Facts with count, fractional parity, decoded StartSouth510 and actual marker/South copies. Derive the three support ones, reduce the whole-field remainder to 0/19/20, and exclude 19/20 using the correctly oriented finite cell permutation and bounded prefix errors. Keep the real 511 self-loop and actual physical941 terminal gate.\n\nExport the exact W%94517 alignment of the original rank shift and preserve all original window witnesses in the polynomial endpoint. Record complete source/check review, fresh direct Lean builds and six standard-only axiom audits. All-cell occupation, native machine semantics and converse/internal-ZFC proofs remain explicit open work; leave the decimal display unchanged.",
